# The bearer token the Obsidian plugin holds, and the only credential it has.
#
# Invent one. `openssl rand -base64 32` is a good source. Paste the same value
# into Obsidian under Settings > Open Publish > Storage.
#
# This is a secret: set it with `wrangler secret put TOKEN`, or let the
# Deploy to Cloudflare button prompt you for it. Do not commit a real value.
TOKEN=
